{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"ox","model_identifier":"ox","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# ox\n\nOx (B2), wild draught breed, 1.75 m at the withers (62 u), about 2.6 m long.\n\nMassive shoulder hump, deep barrel, heavy neck with dewlap, broad head with a pale muzzle, separate jaw, long forward-curving horns (base + forward tip cube each side), two-bone tail with dark switch, cloven hooves. Quadruped rig root > body > neck > head > jaw, body > tail_1 > tail_2, legs upper/lower/foot.\n\n- Cubes: 29 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -16.0..16.0, y 0.0..62.0, z -61.0..32.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- body box 20 x 62 x 62 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = -3, from y = 0; horns reach x +-14, z -57\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop | breathing, head and tail sway |\n| `walk` | 1.3 | loop | 4-beat walk |\n| `run` | 0.62 | loop | heavy gallop |\n| `pull` | 1.7 | loop | slow heavy steps leaning into the yoke (harness at slot_harness) |\n| `charge` | 0.56 | loop | head down, horns forward, full gallop |\n| `graze` | 4.5 | loop | muzzle on the grass, chewing (jaw), odd front step (loop) |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | flinch back |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | falls onto its right side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 39.1 u/s (1.1 m/s), cycle 1.3 s, 51 u per cycle\n- `run`: 177.8 u/s (5.0 m/s), cycle 0.62 s, 110 u per cycle\n- `pull`: 28.4 u/s (0.8 m/s), cycle 1.7 s, 48 u per cycle\n- `charge`: 231.1 u/s (6.5 m/s), cycle 0.56 s, 129 u per cycle\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_harness` on `body` at (0, 62, -22)\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `ox_young.png`: calf texture (use at half scale): lighter brown, pale stubby horns\n\n## Notes\n\n- The young variant still shows the horn cubes; the game can scale them or accept small horns at half scale.\n- slot_harness sits on the shoulder hump in front of the withers: yoke or cart pole attaches there and rides with the body.\n"},"description":"# ox\n\nOx (B2), wild draught breed, 1.75 m at the withers (62 u), about 2.6 m long.\n\nMassive shoulder hump, deep barrel, heavy neck with dewlap, broad head with a pale muzzle, separate jaw, long forward-curving horns (base + forward tip cube each side), two-bone tail with dark switch, cloven hooves. Quadruped rig root > body > neck > head > jaw, body > tail_1 > tail_2, legs upper/lower/foot.\n\n- Cubes: 29 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -16.0..16.0, y 0.0..62.0, z -61.0..32.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- body box 20 x 62 x 62 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = -3, from y = 0; horns reach x +-14, z -57\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop | breathing, head and tail sway |\n| `walk` | 1.3 | loop | 4-beat walk |\n| `run` | 0.62 | loop | heavy gallop |\n| `pull` | 1.7 | loop | slow heavy steps leaning into the yoke (harness at slot_harness) |\n| `charge` | 0.56 | loop | head down, horns forward, full gallop |\n| `graze` | 4.5 | loop | muzzle on the grass, chewing (jaw), odd front step (loop) |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | flinch back |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | falls onto its right side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 39.1 u/s (1.1 m/s), cycle 1.3 s, 51 u per cycle\n- `run`: 177.8 u/s (5.0 m/s), cycle 0.62 s, 110 u per cycle\n- `pull`: 28.4 u/s (0.8 m/s), cycle 1.7 s, 48 u per cycle\n- `charge`: 231.1 u/s (6.5 m/s), cycle 0.56 s, 129 u per cycle\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_harness` on `body` at (0, 62, -22)\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `ox_young.png`: calf texture (use at half scale): lighter brown, pale stubby horns\n\n## Notes\n\n- The young variant still shows the horn cubes; the game can scale them or accept small horns at half scale.\n- slot_harness sits on the shoulder hump in front of the withers: yoke or cart pole attaches there and rides with the body.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"barrel","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-10.0,29.0,-26.0],"to":[10.0,55.0,20.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,44.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[46,46,66.0,72.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[40,0,86.0,26.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[66,46,86.0,72.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,46,46.0,72.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,20.0,46.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[20,0,40.0,46.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"e9bd3efe-2a67-5bbf-afa3-d4434c8939f4"},{"name":"brisket","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-8.0,26.0,-32.0],"to":[8.0,52.0,-26.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,44.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[86,46,102.0,72.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[80,72,86.0,98.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[102,46,118.0,72.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[86,72,92.0,98.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[27,195,43.0,201.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[43,195,59.0,201.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"c5816d4b-8343-5f38-9fe4-d35407cb0db8"},{"name":"shoulders","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-8.5,52.0,-27.0],"to":[8.5,62.0,-10.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,44.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[41,175,58.0,185.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[58,175,75.0,185.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[75,175,92.0,185.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[9